open the incident timed out. Before retrying, I checked the incident list and found it had been created, so I didn't submit it again. There's only one incident.\n- It describes what went wrong, the rollback and the orchestrator error, and lists three follow-ups:\n  - Find out why v2.3.1 failed.\n  - Look into the orchestrator error that stopped the first rollback.\n  - Find out why v2.3.1 was released to production when its release candidate (v2.3.1-rc) had also been unhealthy in staging.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01Qmgg82dcgBcWDPeJjg77Zd", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01K2YRoVw1mmKzSn4avE5khW", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01U9ytU4DkEana6BAmizwXMV", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01GEYeUW6UG5n68guAAK6AcW", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The rollback stopped partway: us-east is on v2.3.0, while us-west and eu-west are still on v2.3.1. Rolling back to v2.3.0 again won't change us-east, so I'll retry once.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01PChNPfYiii997Bw4yqWpdD", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": 